poisons the cache).\n\n- **Wave 3 â€” render is cache-only:** The dashboard row (`render_project_tile_html`) and project header read the cache only â€” no synchronous model run on render; generation runs in the background on `rescan`. Done-when: `pytest` GREEN.\n\n- **Wave 3 â€” folded dashboard reflection (2026-06-14, GREEN):** A mid-build user request â€” \"project-window changes should reflect on the main dashboard timely\" â€” was folded into this wave because it touches the same dashboard-row/summary render path.\n\n- **Wave 3 execution detail:** PART 1 â€” `summarizer.project_extraction_seed` adds per-lane activity; `_project_seed_prompt` rewritten to ask for a grounded 1â€“2 sentence objective; `render_project_markdown` â†’ prose `## Objective`; project header renders the cached `Objective:` line; cache-only render proven by a stub-counter. PART 2 (folded) â€” a read-only `GET /api/...` endpoint (anchor truncated) for in-place dashboard refresh.\n\n- **Member documents (3):** the v5 Master Plan (frozen design), the v5 Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), and the v5 Execution Log.\n\n**Grounding note:** Locked decision 2 and the Wave-3 PART 2 endpoint are truncated in the provided anchors, so those claims are stated only as far as the source text supports."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35217,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35217},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a349a0d0-3419-4963-bcb6-e86ebb5bc626","uuid":"9866f762-ca7f-4ad5-af7c-b4d19067d65d","request_id":"req_011Cc52sCWHMEdtby9iBmXGj"}
